  "description": "Dataverse Developer Diagnostics Workbench turns plug-in trace logs into actionable diagnostics. Load logs by date range, table, message and plugin type, then review recurring errors grouped by a normalized exception fingerprint, slow executions against configurable thresholds, correlation chains rebuilt from correlation and request IDs, and step configuration flags (Update steps without filtering attributes, images that retrieve every column, possible recursion). Results show as colour-coded cards with a detail pane and \"Copy as Markdown\", and export to CSV or a self-contained HTML report (optionally redacted).",
